A: (@draw o_cake o_80 o_day@) Can you read a whole Tolstoy story in Russian? Ию́ль. У Ни́ны Петро́вны юбиле́й: ей исполня́ется во́семьдесят.

    erase o_80 o_day

A: Мы с Ма́шей у неё в гостя́х. Послу́шайте.
    draw nina nina_name p_tom p_tom_name p_masha p_masha_name

    ask "Нина Петровна, Tom's neighbour, talks about a story by Tolstoy. What is it about? (дру́жба: from друг)" listen [{"voice":"b","who":"Ни́на Петро́вна","text":"Том, вы зна́ете расска́з Толсто́го «Лев и соба́чка»?","gloss":"Tom, do you know Tolstoy's story «The Lion and the Little Dog»?"},{"voice":"a","who":"Tom","text":"Нет. А о чём он?","gloss":"No. What is it about?"},{"voice":"b","who":"Ни́на Петро́вна","text":"О дру́жбе. И он начина́ется в Ло́ндоне!","gloss":"About friendship. And it begins in London!"},{"voice":"a","who":"Tom","text":"В Ло́ндоне? Мы с Ма́шей прочита́ем его́ вам!","gloss":"In London? Masha and I will read it to you!"},{"voice":"b","who":"Ни́на Петро́вна","text":"Спаси́бо! Я чита́ла его́, когда́ была́ ма́ленькой.","gloss":"Thank you! I read it when I was a little girl."}] options ["friendship","a long journey","a war"] correct 1
        right: О дру́жбе: about friendship.
        wrong: О дру́жбе: about friendship.
    voice a

    ask "Where does the story begin?" listen same options ["in London","in Moscow","in Petersburg"] correct 1
        right: В Ло́ндоне!
        wrong: Он начина́ется в Ло́ндоне: in London.
    voice a

    ask "When did Нина Петровна read it?" listen same options ["when she was a little girl","last year","yesterday"] correct 1
        right: Когда́ была́ ма́ленькой.
        wrong: Когда́ была́ ма́ленькой: as a little girl.
    voice a

    ask "What will Tom and Masha do?" listen same options ["read the story to her","buy her the book","see a film of it"] correct 1
        right: Мы с Ма́шей прочита́ем его́ вам!
        wrong: Мы прочита́ем его́ вам: they'll read it to her.
    voice a

    erase nina nina_name p_tom p_tom_name p_masha p_masha_name o_cake

A: Лев: a lion. Со львом, ко льву́: the е drops.
    draw w_lion w_lev w_lev_g

A: Соба́чка: соба́ка, lesson 144, made small and dear with -ка: к becomes ч.
    draw w_dog w_sob w_sob_g

A: И Толсто́й — Лев Толсто́й! The other new words have their gloss under them.
    draw w_tolstoy

    erase w_lion w_lev w_lev_g w_dog w_sob w_sob_g w_tolstoy

