audio:
  lang: en
  lines:
    '|a||Reading Tolstoy in Russian: The Lion and the Little Dog':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4120
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||A lion, a little dog and a cage in London: read Tolstoy''s «Лев и собачка» in Russian, adapted, on Нина Петровна''s eightieth birthday.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1ojid8r'
    '|a||Can you read a whole Tolstoy story in Russian? Ию́ль. У Ни́ны Петро́вны юбиле́й: ей исполня́ется во́семьдесят.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11280
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Мы с Ма́шей у неё в гостя́х. Послу́шайте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:qa3xs1'
    '|b||Том, вы зна́ете расска́з Толсто́го «Лев и соба́чка»?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3960
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:12klsey'
    '|a||Нет. А о чём он?':
