      ms: 5880
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Соба́чка: соба́ка, lesson 144, made small and dear with -ка: к becomes ч.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8440
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:7ea0ad'
    '|a||И Толсто́й — Лев Толсто́й! The other new words have their gloss under them.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1x3axgf'
    '|a||Прочита́йте са́ми. Пото́м чита́ем мы с Ма́шей.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3320
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:7mkz9p'
    '|a||В Ло́ндоне пока́зывали ди́ких звере́й.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1cfc24u'
    '|a||За биле́т бра́ли де́ньги и́ли соба́ку — зверя́м на обе́д.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5120
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:12x35n5'
    '|a||Одному́ челове́ку хоте́лось посмотре́ть звере́й.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:h8mmm9'
    '|a||Он взял на у́лице ма́ленькую соба́чку и пришёл с ней к зверя́м.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1ywpunm'
    '|a||Соба́чку взя́ли и отнесли́ в кле́тку ко льву́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1v6o4ia'
    '|a||Да́льше. Тепе́рь чита́ет Ма́ша.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2840
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:14otnjq'
    '|b||Соба́чке бы́ло стра́шно.':
