      ms: 4200
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:664q3y'
    '|b||Когда́ хозя́ин дал льву мя́са, лев оста́вил немно́го соба́чке.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4760
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:nmbkhv'
    '|b||Ве́чером лев спал, а соба́чка положи́ла го́лову ему́ на ла́пу.':
