      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1q2yc3f'
    '|a||С тех пор соба́чка жила́ в одно́й кле́тке со львом.':
